{"name": "Northanda Chronicles", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Void is devouring the ancient realm of Northanda.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4bf8f82f80d5873e3f4ba83972d1e6f0.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"535\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"562\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a party of legendary heroes in this tactical role-based deckbuilder. Master strategic battles with deep synergies between cards and heroes based on their roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/8243347e6be17beb513a9dd5afd0448d.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"234\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the party alive with extra resources, card manipulation, and powerful buffs at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/404e4ba18f73aa3dd7b36f42a20c4734.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"234\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploit enemy weaknesses with devastating attacks, scale into powerful combinations to overpower your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/3cdfe162a959c7772aeacbb6c960aa9d.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"234\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw enemy focus and shield allies from harm by redirecting attacks and mitigating incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e8cfd452db139571897b9fac5a01d90d.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"393\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit three heroes from countless possible combinations to form an unbreakable team. Each hero brings their own card library and playstyle, unlocking wildly different synergies and endless ways to personalize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"chart your own path\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/c2ba64e19217ee1c8aa7f616734601ef.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"376\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dangerous dungeons through <strong>Encounter Cards</strong>, each offering unique risks and rewards. Face encounters in any order, or set up camp to wait out the harsh night. Pick your battles wisely as you journey toward each dungeon's corrupted heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/78a2043c2aec817cf5f474d5f01fbd30.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"333\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"562\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your heroes share a single deck, but each hero controls their own mana pool, which regenerates slowly over time. The most powerful combos require clever deckbuilding and cooperation between heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e7701fda535fc21cf7e69f75445d2513.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"349\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"412\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/b03f7cacf8a05f9ae8272ff8aaaac64d.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/b03f7cacf8a05f9ae8272ff8aaaac64d.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow stronger through deep and branching upgrade paths. Each run offers new ways to grow stronger and push back the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 Discover powerful <strong>Artifacts</strong> that redefine how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 Enhance cards with <strong>Gems</strong> to unlock their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 Seek\u00a0<strong>Blessings</strong>\u00a0from the ancient Aspects for otherworldly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 Use tactical <strong>Items</strong> to overcome obstacles, and open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"27\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/752a58d951285f8096d32856cbd4ce58.webp?t=1784127916\" width=\"325\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"192\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/d0795247e7afdec177bd3cc8544c397c.poster.avif?t=1784127916\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/d0795247e7afdec177bd3cc8544c397c.webm?t=1784127916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Master role-based deckbuilding in Northanda Chronicles, a tactical roguelike deckbuilder. Build a party around the RPG holy trinity from countless hero combinations, craft a shared deck with powerful synergies, and fight to save Northanda from the devouring Void.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/31c39d282fedd04fd24fd226cae7d729a1c3b5a6/header.jpg?t=1784127916", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Deckbuilding", "Card Battler", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based", "Party-Based RPG"], "developers": "Hyperfocus Interactive", "publishers": "Hyperfocus Interactive", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2068650", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7QIWYjtPJPQ", "first_seen": 1777845600.0, "review_rank": 726}